      "review_summary": "The PR wraps post-open gateway-lock payload writing in cleanup logic and adds a Vitest regression for the `writeFile` rejection path.\n\nPR surface: Source +8, Tests +23. Total +31 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source-level reproduction is high confidence: make `fs.open(lockPath, \"wx\")` succeed and the returned `FileHandle.writeFile` reject; current main has no cleanup before throwing `GatewayLockError`, though I did not run a mutating failure-injection test in this read-only review.",
